		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Azure dragon whose copper scales form Draconic glyphs. 50 feet long, wind-swift.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 62, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8 + obliterate) or 1 vortex breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fireblood</strong>. Fire immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Dragon and riders can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vortex Breath</strong>. One target with double near of dragon, DEX 15+ or sucked into pocket dimension. Total darkness inside, airless, target starts suffocating. Dragon regurgitates all swallowed if slain.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
